  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math>.</p><p>Hence, the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is logically equivalent to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math>.</p>",
